    "detailed_description": "SpaceCrooks is a hybrid rail-shooter/flight-sim (Starfox-clone) that combines roguelite gameplay with an unlocking comedic sci-fi visual novel. Follow kAla, \u2669\u2669B\u2084\u266f\u2669C\u266d\u2669E\u266d, and <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300840/extras/219621c4d1dd72c52fd40efe08088c86.webp?t=1675966958\" /></div> as they carve a path of mayhem in this genre soup.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedurally generated enemy drones and boss ships with individually destructible weapons and armor</li><li>Weapon and item drops with incredible randomized enhancements</li><li>A wide variety of procedurally generated landscapes and tunnels that smoothly mix organic and inorganic environments.</li><li>Special madlibs-style procedurally generated NPCs and mission plotlines to interact with</li><li>Separate, non-procedural events forming a parallel over-arching narrative</li></ul>",
